---
title: WebSocket Architecture
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser
  participant STOMP as WebSocket/STOMP
  participant Security as Connection Auth
  participant Module as Messaging/Notification Service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Redis

  Browser->>STOMP: CONNECT /ws with token
  STOMP->>Security: Validate identity and destination access
  Security-->>STOMP: Principal established
  Browser->>STOMP: SUBSCRIBE /user/queue/notifications
  Browser->>STOMP: SEND /app/conversations/{id}/messages
  STOMP->>Module: Command with authenticated user
  Module->>DB: Persist message/notification
  Module->>Redis: Publish realtime event
  Redis-->>Module: Event fan-out
  Module-->>STOMP: Message DTO
  STOMP-->>Browser: /topic or /user/queue delivery
